>Emergency toilet quick card
If told not to flush, contain the waste.
Line a stable lidded bucket with two strong bags. Add suitable absorbent. Close both bags before they are heavy; store in a covered leak-resistant container away from food and water. Follow local collection instructions. Wash hands with soap and safe water.

